I
1100 Version - synthetic fixture for the openair_db atc.dat fallback tests.
Hand-written: no vendor data is reproduced. Squares sit on the same lat 40..41
grid as tests/fixtures/openair/classify.txt so the two sources can be probed
at the SAME points and their precedence observed directly.

  lon 0-1  FALLBACK CTR    role twr     0-2500      overlaps ALPHA CTR (openair wins)
  lon 9-10 LONE TRACON     role tracon  1500-10000  openair knows nothing here
  lon 9-10 LONE CENTER     role ctr     0-24500     the stack above it

CONTROLLER
NAME FALLBACK CTR
FACILITY_ID TST1
ROLE twr
CLASS D
ICAO TST1
CHAN 118000
AIRSPACE_POLYGON_BEGIN     0  2500
POINT 40.000000 0.000000
POINT 41.000000 0.000000
POINT 41.000000 1.000000
POINT 40.000000 1.000000
AIRSPACE_POLYGON_END
CONTROLLER_END

CONTROLLER
NAME LONE TRACON
FACILITY_ID TST2
ROLE tracon
CLASS C
ICAO TST2
CHAN 119000
AIRSPACE_POLYGON_BEGIN  1500 10000
POINT 40.000000 9.000000
POINT 41.000000 9.000000
POINT 41.000000 10.000000
POINT 40.000000 10.000000
AIRSPACE_POLYGON_END
CONTROLLER_END

CONTROLLER
NAME LONE CENTER
FACILITY_ID TST3
ROLE ctr
CLASS C
ICAO TST3
CHAN 120000
AIRSPACE_POLYGON_BEGIN     0 24500
POINT 39.000000 8.000000
POINT 42.000000 8.000000
POINT 42.000000 11.000000
POINT 39.000000 11.000000
AIRSPACE_POLYGON_END
CONTROLLER_END
